      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm unable to reproduce this in desktop mode with reproduction steps from OP, but I've seen many bug reports about this issue affecting multiple users.\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/68987e\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/y-vr\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/chatbox-not-showing-up\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/keyboard-and-mouse-input-stop-responding-after-opening-the-chatbox\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/ui-freeze-unexpectly",
